a custom video player system that has NOOOO limits!
You don't gotta upload a video for like 2k robux using VideoFrame, which has a 20 second limit.
This system however allows you to download a video file from your own GitHub repository (although you need to convert it into RGBA pixel buffers)
and supports any video length or FPS. I do have to mention though, the max resolution a video can have is 1024x1024,
meaning for 16:9 videos (which you're gonna use a LOT for stuff like cinematics) you'd have to use 1014x570.
Other than that though, this system is very flexible and will receive even better polishing and features in the near future.
You could even use this for like, some cinematics or cutscenes ig, after all you can play any video with it.


